cFamily20,1\":188047360,\"iPad13,7\":188047360,\"iPad16,4-B\":187627520,\"iPhone13,4\":212893696,\"iPhone12,5\":212893696,\"iPhone7,2\":199394304,\"iPhone8,4\":199394304,\"iPad14,5-A\":187627520,\"iPhone15,5\":212473856,\"iPhone10,1\":199828480,\"iPad4,1\":199394304,\"iPhone7,1\":225301504,\"iPad11,1\":190974976,\"iPad14,6-B\":187627520,\"iPad13,4\":188047360,\"iPad8,4\":199828480,\"iPad13,6\":188047360,\"iPad16,5-B\":187627520}},\"relationships\":{\"app-events\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/app-events?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"5750138391\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T09:36:34Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14552798,\"body\":\"Hello dear! We are happy to be with you in Yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will also be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live.\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-09T01:42:46Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been using this app for a good amount of time , my experience has been superb so far👌👌. After joining in yalla,  everyone welcomed me like a family and I became one of them eventually. Here, I’ve been talking to different people, making friends, playing games , earning gifts and doing many other lucrative  activities. This app has made my online time worthwhile. ❤️❤️\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"A big shout-out to yalla\",\"userName\":\"Frenkie'10\"}},{\"id\":\"4284196784\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-08T15:22:46Z\",\"review\":\"If you asked questions nobody would answer, they would just say random things over and over again. The viewers would just do nothing. If I asked if they were real there would be not 1 comment. If there was a comment it wasn’t even related to what I was talking about. I don’t recommend getting this app.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Jomara Blenkharn\",\"title\":\"Unprofessional\"}},{\"id\":\"5749915856\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-02T08:32:32Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14646972,\"body\":\"Hi, most users (more than 99%) enjoy Yalla for free and they love to have fun with many friends together. Let us work together to develop Yalla to be the best Arab community for our brothers and sisters. If you have any suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live and we hope to see your distinguished comment with the five stars. Thank you!\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-14T05:29:30Z\"},\"review\":\"I’m using this app since last couple of months and I just forgot other apps for time pass. honestly I found a lot of good friends here and in party time I feel like I’m in a party house. just awesome. strongly recommending for all.... 😍😍\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"yalla is my favourite app since last few months..\",\"userName\":\"crowwwn\"}},{\"id\":\"4275811272\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-07T04:18:40Z\",\"review\":\"Takes forever to deactivate the account! The only option to to it is to contact the customer service. Takes a while. Very disappointed. Creating an account is easy, getting rid of it is a headache. So think twice\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Quick\u0026easy photo collge maker\",\"userName\":\"Joed Kimmings\"}},{\"id\":\"4290748067\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T18:21:14Z\",\"review\":\"I enjoy moco several times daily. The poker rooms have live interaction with other players and I even got a date ... occasional glitches that seem to be worked out whenever noticed ... but overall worth it. It's a complex of various social games and media .. mostly uncensored I believe ...\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Levertis Tregunnah\",\"title\":\"Love the app! but suggestions\"}},{\"id\":\"4286221241\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-09T01:35:33Z\",\"review\":\"So I got this app 2 years ago and I registered my phone number In. I now have TikTok and I can’t add my number in because it’s in here. (I’m guessing the two apps are related somehow) and I’ve tried to delete my number and log out of this app but it never works. Don’t get this app if you are planning on getting TikTok\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Kennieth Kemish\",\"title\":\"Great App!!\"}},{\"id\":\"4273010830\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-06T14:55:01Z\",\"review\":\"When I was on the phone with my friend it was being all glitchy and not working it really upset me because you said the ad said that it was really good quality and it really upsets me that it wasn’t so if you could fix the quality now please it was really glitchy I’m not very happy\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Madisyn Currer\",\"title\":\"Exciting, isnt it?\"}},{\"id\":\"4280864750\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-08T02:16:08Z\",\"review\":\"this app is awesome for video chatting with your best friends calling people messaging people and so much more like taking photos and sending it to your friends drawing on the screen well chatting with someone this app is awesome I recommend this for anyone who wants to get it\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Rella Ranscombe\",\"title\":\"Fun App but....\"}},{\"id\":\"6107935027\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-06-22T11:33:15Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":16154760,\"body\":\"Dear users:Please check whether your device allows Yalla to run. If the above problem still exists, please send relevant screenshots to feedback, thank you!\",\"modified\":\"2020-06-23T01:32:49Z\"},\"review\":\"I'm using this app since 3years on my ipad mini but from last week yalla is not working on my ipad I reinstalled the app and also reset my ipad but still doesn't work. When i open yalla suddenly it's shutdown and after that when i open yalla it is ask me to login again. Everything is working perfectly fine on my iPad rather than yalla. And also on my other phone yalla is working perfectly fine. Please solve my problem. Thank you\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Not working on ipad mini\",\"userName\":\"Farwai009\"}},{\"id\":\"5817411675\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-04-16T00:31:21Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":14626098,\"body\":\"Dear user, we apologize for what happened to you, we will verify and deal with what you said, Yalla is committed to establishing a standardized and fair customer service team, thank you for your love for yalla, we will do our best Create a beautiful environment for you ~\",\"modified\":\"2020-04-13T09:11:56Z\"},\"review\":\"Yalla is really awkward application i am sending emails from 10 days that i have one issue in hindi region but hindi region owner Lost Atlantis and CS Arif Sarkar bangali they disturb whole hindi regoin but no one take action against both of them i am using this application since 156.\\nPlease don't install this app yalla technology say 99% users are saying about application but they are telling a lie with public.\\nResolve my issue then give your comment of this post on playstore\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":true,\"userName\":\"55873785\",\"title\":\"complantlaint against lost atlantis and arif sarkar\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1100991711\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100991711?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=1100991711\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"price\":0.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"100 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 100 Yalla Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/100-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1100998137\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1100998137?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=8990\u0026salableAdamId=1100998137\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.twoDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$8.99\",\"price\":8.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.twoDA\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"1000 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 1000 Yalla Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/1000-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1101003999\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1101003999?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=99990\u0026salableAdamId=1101003999\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.fourDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$99.99\",\"price\":99.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.fourDA\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"12000 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 12000 Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/12000-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1101002449\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1101002449?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=43990\u0026salableAdamId=1101002449\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.threeDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$43.99\",\"price\":43.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.threeDA\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"5000 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 5000 Yalla Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/5000-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1205406797\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1205406797?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=399990\u0026salableAdamId=1205406797\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.pro.fiveDA\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$399.99\",\"price\":399.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.fiveDA\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"50000 Golds\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Purchase this item, you will get 50000 Yalla Golds.\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/50000-golds/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1503464570\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1503464570?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=49990\u0026salableAdamId=1503464570\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.roomlock.one\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$49.99\",\"price\":49.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.roomlock.one\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"1-Month Use of Room Lock\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Subscribe to get 1-month use of room lock\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/1-month-use-of-room-lock/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1561939345\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1561939345?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=19990\u0026salableAdamId=1561939345\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.membership.one\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$19.99\",\"price\":19.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[],\"recurringSubscriptionPeriod\":\"P1M\"}],\"subscriptionFamilyRank\":2,\"subscriptionFamilyName\":\"Yalla Premium Monthly Subscription\",\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.membership.one\",\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Get monthly 2100 Gold Coins \u0026 many privileges\"},\"subscriptionFamilyId\":\"20608200\",\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/patrician-premium-membership/id1091902866\",\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"Patrician - Premium Membership\"}},{\"id\":\"6593680443\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6593680443?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=11990\u0026salableAdamId=6593680443\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.yalla.apple.monthlycard.one\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$11.99\",\"price\":11.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.yalla.apple.monthlycard.one\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"Month Card\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Get a total of 2000 golds across 30 days\"},\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/month-card/id1091902866\"}},{\"id\":\"1567843595\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/1567843595?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=39990\u0026salableAdamId=1567843595\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026offerName=com.weieyu.yalla.membership.two\u0026appAdamId=1091902866\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$39.99\",\"price\":39.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[],\"recurringSubscriptionPeriod\":\"P1M\"}],\"subscriptionFamilyRank\":1,\"subscriptionFamilyName\":\"Yalla Premium Monthly Subscription\",\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.membership.two\",\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Get monthly 4500 gold coins \u0026 many privileges\"},\"subscriptionFamilyId\":\"20608200\",\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/knight-premium-membership/id1091902866\",\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"Knight - Premium Membership\"}}]},\"developer-other-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1091902866/developer-other-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1419536376\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1419536376?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Used to Track You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be used to track you across apps and websites owned by other companies:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"9+\",\"value\":200,\"rank\":2,\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Mature/Suggestive Themes\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipad\",\"ipod\"],\"chartPositions\":{\"appStore\":{\"position\":56,\"genreName\":\"Family\",\"genre\":7009,\"chart\":\"top-free\",\"genreShortName\":\"Family\",\"chartLink\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/charts/iphone/family-games/7009\"}},\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/yalla-ludo-ludo-domino/id1419536376\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4.3,\"ratingCount\":21428,\"ratingCountList\":[2266,695,819,1449,16199],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.3 stars\"},\"genreDisplayName\":\"Board\",\"name\":\"Yalla Ludo - Ludo\u0026Domino\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipad\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPad\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iPadOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 11.0 or later and a Mac with Apple M1 chip or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Yalla Ludo, featuring real-time voice chat, enables you to enjoy Ludo and Domino games with your friends online.\\n\\nReal-time voice chat\\nEngage in real-time voice chats with fellow players anytime, make new friends, and enjoy every moment of the game!\\n\\nVarious game modes\\nLudo: This includes 2 \u0026 4 Player modes and Team mode. Each mode has 4 gameplay styles: Classic, Master, Quick, and Arrow. \\nYou can also play the enchanting Magic mode. \\nDomino: This includes 2 \u0026 4 Player modes, with each mode having two gameplay styles: Draw Game and All Five. \\nOther games: A variety of new and exciting games await your discovery!\\n\\nHave fun with friends\\nTeam mode, private rooms, and local rooms offer the flexibility to play with friends both online and offline. Invite your friends and enjoy gaming together!\\n\\nVoice chat Room\\nThe chat room opens up a world where you can interact with gamers globally. Share gaming tips, send adorable gifts, and invite others to join you in Ludo \u0026 Domino. Grab the mic and experience fantastic moments in Yalla Ludo!\\n\\nLooking for extra game bonuses? Discover them with Yalla Ludo VIP.\\nSubscribe to Yalla Ludo VIP to unlock additional advanced features:\\nCollect free daily golds, diamonds, and daily VIP benefits.\\nEnjoy access to privileged game rooms: create your own room in the VIP room, invite friends for shared gameplay, and explore enhanced betting options.\\n\\n-----------------------------------\\n\\nIf you choose to subscribe to Yalla Ludo VIP, the purchase will be billed to your iTunes account.\\nYour iTunes account will be charged automatically for the renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\\nYou can manage and cancel your subscriptions at any time by going to your iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\\nLudo VIP includes two types: Knight and Baron. The price for Knight is USD 11.99/month and the price for Baron is USD 39.99/month. Prices are in U.S. dollars, may vary in countries other than the U.S., and are subject to change without notice.\\nNo cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period. You could still have great fun in Yalla Ludo without becoming a Yalla Ludo VIP.\\n\\nWe are committed to giving our all in delivering more entertaining games that will enrich your daily experiences!\\n\\n\\nPrivacy Policy：https://www.fyxtechhk.com/term/EN/TermOfService.html\\n\\nTerms of Service：https://www.fyxtechhk.com/term/EN/TermOfService.html#TermsOfService\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Royal 5 Super Privileges are coming: Exclusive skins, vehicles, profile cards, and other privileges!\\n2. Sign-in benefits: The higher your level, the more sign-in rewards you can collect daily.\\n3. Feed list for chat rooms is coming soon.\\n4. Fixed the issue of being unable to log in to the game with X account and optimized the gaming experience. \\n\\nThere's more content for you to explore and enjoy!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-16T00:01:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Great news! The Royal Level has been upgraded to include Holiday Surprises and the Fortune Store. Claim holiday rewards and redeem exclusive skins and items with Fortune Coins.\\n2. Skin Fragments Exchange: Now you can exchange your excess skin fragments for higher-tier skins or golds.\\n3. Room Battle mode is coming soon: Join your preferred team within rooms. Try to win more battle points to earn glory.\\nThere's more content for you to explore and enjoy!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-17T08:00:43Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.9.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Bug Fixed.\\r\\nExplore more updates in Yalla Ludo!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-18T06:02:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.9.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Bug Fixed.\\nExplore more updates in Yalla Ludo!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-28T10:06:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.9.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1.Great news! Unique IDs now include new animation effects and extra 8-digit IDs. You can purchase and switch Unique IDs more easily. \\r\\n2.Color-customized gifts are now available. You can customize the gift color to your liking!\\r\\n3. Mic numbers have increased. A mode with 15 microphones is now available. Invite more friends on the mic to chat and enjoy more fun!\\r\\nThere's more content for you to explore and enjoy!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-09T02:34:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.9.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Get ready for Jungle Ludo! The jungle is packed with secrets and spectacular items. Warriors, gear up for some adventures!\\r\\n \\r\\n2. Double-tap to like a Chat Room! Want to show some love? Just double-tap on an empty spot in the room. The more taps, the bigger the combo effects. Help your favorite rooms shine!\\r\\n \\r\\n3. Introducing Crocodile Dentist, a new mini-game, in chat rooms! Gather your friends for a game, take turns, and see who’s daring enough to face the bite. Who will it be?\\r\\n \\r\\nRamadan's Coming! We've got lots of new stuff for you to check out and enjoy. Stay tuned!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-07T01:59:54Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.9.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Bug Fixed.\\nExplore more updates in Yalla Ludo!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-18T06:43:30Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.9.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Introducing a brand-new profile page! Decorate your profile page with ornaments, profile themes, and profile cards to express your personality. Explore additional details such as game records, gift walls, and badges when you visit your profile page.\\r\\n\\r\\n2. Visit the Rank list to view the Achievement badge wall. Check out the rankings and see who's on top.\\r\\n\\r\\n3. We've added Gift Scoring to the chat room! Earn points by receiving gifts while on the mic. Come and give it a try!\\r\\n\\r\\nThe 5th anniversary is approaching! Take a look at our new logo, launch page, and background image. Join us for our anniversary celebration. There's more content for you to explore and enjoy!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-26T00:35:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.8.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Bug Fixed.\\r\\nExplore more updates in Yalla Ludo!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-16T07:15:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.8.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Fixed X login issues and game experience optimization.\\r\\nExplore more updates in Yalla Ludo!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-20T00:59:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.8.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Generous Login Rewards: Log in monthly for profile frames and collect 12 months to unlock a bonus permanent limited profile frame.\\n2. Room Activity Notice: Create notices for activities and invite others to join your party.\\n3. Personalized Playlists: Take control of your music with our playlist management feature. Organize your favorite songs effortlessly.\\nExplore more updates in Yalla Ludo!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-25T02:51:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Fight Ludo - Kill the maximum tokens within a specific time limit and emerge as the champion!\\n2. Happy Birthday - Set your birthday, and come to Yalla Ludo on your birthday to collect gifts and throw joyous parties in the room! \\n3. Room Pass - Engage with your friends in the room for a chance to win special rewards! (Refreshed every 14 days)\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-20T02:31:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Elite Rewards Tower - Unlock the Elite Reward Tower to receive even more rewards!\\r\\n2. New Stickers - Utilize stickers in games, private conversations, and chat rooms!\\r\\n3. Personalized Gifts - Send gifts that feature recipients' profile pictures to show your appreciation!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-05-16T01:33:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixed\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-29T10:38:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Ramadan UI Design - Enjoy the new user interface designed for Ramadan and celebrate together!\\r\\n2. Arrow Mode - Experience a new game mode in Ludo that is more exciting!\\r\\n3. Higher Max Level - Play games to reach a higher max level of 80 at an optimized upgrade speed!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-17T06:26:34Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Bug fixed\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-30T10:53:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Snakes \u0026 Ladders - Enjoy the newly added classic game of Snakes \u0026 Ladders. You'll love the excitement and thrill of this timeless game!\\r\\n2. Champion Challenge - Get ready for the new Domino Champion Challenge! Play now and win free Domino skins!\\r\\n3. Random Wheel – This newly added mini-game lets you spin the wheel to have more fun with friends in the chat rooms!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-30T01:57:38Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. Optimized Royal Privilege - You can choose the room theme you like as the private chat theme;\\r\\n2. Optimized Restart the Journey - More missions are waiting for you to explore;\\r\\n3. Added Backpack System - You can obtain gifts and magic cards in the backpacks through activities and tasks.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-29T05:47:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Bug fixed - The sound issue in the room has been resolved.\\n2. Royal Privileges -  You can enrich your bio and use your dice skins in the Chat Room.\\n3. Optimized Member System - Owners of the top 10 member clubs can obtain honor badges.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-08-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-08-02T00:50:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1. New Login Method - Login with YallaChat and get an exclusive profile frame.\\r\\n2. Royal Privileges -  You can enrich your bio and use your dice skins in the Chat Room.\\r\\n3. Optimized Member System - Owners of the top 10 member clubs can obtain honor badges.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-07-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-07-29T03:59:52Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1.Restart the journey : special missions for players who return after 30-days offline. \\r\\n2.Added in-game interactive stickers.\\r\\n3.Added royal privileges and optimized gifts in Chat Room.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-09T05:46:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\n1. Newly designed Ramadan User Interface.\\n2. Added Reward Tower: You can now collect Plentiful new rewards.\\n3. Optimized Royal system: Added new exclusive Royal vehicles and tips on how to maintain your Royal Level.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-03-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-03-25T02:41:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.9.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1.Optimized Level Logos: Higher levels will get you more dazzling logos;\\r\\n2.Optimized Global Ranking: You can locate yourself on the ranking by simply tapping your rank;\\r\\n3.Added On-Mic Emojis: You can express yourself even without speaking to others;\\r\\n4.Added Room Operation Records;\\r\\n5.Bugs fixed and performance improved.\\r\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-27T08:31:43Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.8.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1.Added Battle Pass: New players can collect plentiful rewards by completing easy tasks. Get even more rewards by upgrading to Elite Pass;\\r\\n2.Brand new Shop system and new items: New Unique IDs and Profile Cards. You can buy and use new items to distinct yourself from others;\\r\\n3.Added Royal privileges: The recharge ticket allows you to get an extra recharge bonus. More limited items including dice skins, room themes, and profile cards for you to choose from;\\r\\n4.Added Stopwatch and Timer: You can use the stopwatch and timer in the Chat room;\\r\\n5.Added Fruit Fight in the Chat Room: In the game, each player will be assigned a fruit by the system randomly. The player needs to tell the host which fruit he wants to slice. The winner is the last player whose fruit is sliced;\\r\\n6.Optimized season settlement page: The final rank of the last season is added to the page;\\r\\n7.Optimized horse image: Hope you will like the new horse image;\\r\\n8.Bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-15T03:41:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.7.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Updates:\\r\\n1.Changed icon color: to celebrate the 50th UAE National Day, the app icon color is changed;\\r\\n2.Bugs fixed.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-25T13:49:15Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"ht