g/us/genres/6016?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"parentName\":\"App Store\",\"name\":\"Entertainment\",\"url\":\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/genre/id6016\",\"parentId\":\"36\"}}]},\"developer\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1377028992/developer?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1720696037\",\"type\":\"developers\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/developers/1720696037?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"genreNames\":[],\"editorialArtwork\":{},\"name\":\"GOOD ONLINE TECHNOLOGY PTE.LTD.\",\"mediaType\":\"Mobile Software Applications\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/good-online-technology-pte-ltd/id1720696037\"}}]}},\"meta\":{\"contentVersion\":{\"RTCI\":1732304741992,\"MZ_INDEXER\":1733337866693}}},{\"id\":\"1534252521\",\"type\":\"apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/1534252521?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"distributionKind\":\"APP_STORE\",\"supportsArcade\":false,\"isFirstPartyHideableApp\":false,\"privacy\":{\"privacyTypes\":[{\"privacyType\":\"Data Used to Track You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_USED_TO_TRACK_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be used to track you across apps and websites owned by other companies:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected and linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Contact Info\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACT_INFO\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"User Content\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Identifiers\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Usage Data\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Data Not Linked to You\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"17+\",\"value\":600,\"rank\":4,\"advisories\":[\"Infrequent/Mild Cartoon or Fantasy Violence\",\"Frequent/Intense Simulated Gambling\",\"Infrequent/Mild Mature/Suggestive Themes\",\"Infrequent/Mild Realistic Violence\",\"Infrequent/Mild Profanity or Crude Humor\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":true,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/4fun-live-voice-play-ludo/id1534252521\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":4,\"ratingCount\":115,\"ratingCountList\":[21,5,5,10,74],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"4.0 stars\"},\"name\":\"4Fun - Live Voice, Play Ludo\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"artistName\":\"SPREADFUN\",\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"The app that people in Saudi Arabia and the UAE are paying attention to! 4Fun is a popular group voice chat app for arabs in KSA and UAE.\\n\\n\\nRAMADAN KAREEM! As Ramadhan approaches, 4Fun will add audio rooms for Quran recitation, hadith explanation, charity, zakat, and Ramadan content. Let's spend Ramadan online together, enjoy the peaceful Ramadan, and relax yourself.\\n\\n\\nRecommended community to make friends:\\nExplore friends and chat rooms that interest you. Make friends with interesting souls through your voice. It's a safe, warm and stress-free community.\\n\\n\\nOnline Party to entertain with your friends:\\nWhy not try to have a fun online party? You can chat with friends of the arab world anytime and anywhere about hot trends, emotions, fashion, football, work...\\n\\n\\nPlay Mdagsh with your friends:\\nMdagsh is a local KSA game. In the game, the banker need to choose question other players or not according to their own cards, while other players can choose to accept or increase. They compare the cards to decide which one is the winner, it’s depends on luck and their choices.\\n\\n\\nVarious Games that Saudis are playing:\\nLudo, , Uno……Nearly 10 popular local games for you to choose from! 4fun provides everyone with a wonderful gaming world.\\n\\n\\nFEATURES:\\n\\nMAKE FRIENDS- Meet friends that suit you instantly and easily! Friends are crowded into ROOMs, MOMENT \u0026 PRIVATE CHAT. On 4Fun, you never know who you might meet!\\n\\nDELICATE DESIGN- Stunning animated gifts, vehicles, headwears for you to show your taste and personality.\\n\\nUNIQUE HONOR-Special id, beautiful badges, SVIP, luxury ranking, Customized Gifts for you to show your uniqueness.\\n\\nROOM PARTY-Attend parties with different themes: Chat, Singles Club, Couples, Girls, Travel, AFC.\\n\\nGAMES- Play games with different arabs!\\n\\nMessage us: support@spread-fun.com\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\n1. User experience optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-19T02:38:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\n1. Added in-app purchase items\\r\\n2. User experience optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-11T02:05:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\n1. Gameplay upgrade\\r\\n2. Login experience optimization\\r\\n3. Better user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-11-04T02:02:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\n1. SVIP privilege optimization\\r\\n2. User experience optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-22T03:23:36Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\n1. Optimize some user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-10-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-10-12T02:40:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\n1. Upgrade the room treasure box function experience\\r\\n2. Optimize user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-21T14:44:04Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Update content:\\r\\nUser experience upgrade and optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-09-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-09-07T11:37:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update content:\\r\\nImprove user experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-24T01:43:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"User experience optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-16T02:04:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Room chat issue fixed\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-06T02:55:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added the function of clearing chat history in the room\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-08-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-08-03T09:18:03Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Performance experience optimization ensures you enjoy superior services.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-19\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-19T09:31:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Boosted Performance with Lower CPU Usage!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-13T08:44:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Private chat and room add report function\\r\\n2.Feedback experience optimization\\r\\n3.User experience optimization\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-07-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-07-05T03:41:26Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Basic experience improvements to enhance overall user satisfaction.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-22T12:31:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version update:\\r\\n1. Added password login, more convenient login\\r\\n2. New upgrade of SVIP privileges\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-08T05:06:48Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This version mainly updates the profile page optimization to make your experience better.\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-06-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-06-03T02:40:07Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have optimized the performance of the chat room to make your experience better.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-18T07:01:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"In this version we have optimized the login function to make your experience even better.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-13T06:37:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have been working on making the 4Fun experience better, and in this version we have improved the design of the gift package,we hope this will bring you a better experience!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-25T03:45:33Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have added The Title to make your experience even better!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-23T03:49:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"In this version we have added the function of modify country, you can now update the version to experience it.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-11T02:15:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2.0.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have optimized the Item loading process to bring you a better experience.\",\"r